 `_output_segment_hashes`, and the row builder now sets `_output_message_hashes` from it.\n  - `log_row_extras` takes tool call ids from the turn's output messages.\n  - It also collects output `ToolResultPart`s.\n  - Every tool call and result carries a `server_executed` key, placed right after `\"exception\"` in results.\n  - Server results get their `parts` row id from the output messages.\n- **`llm/cli.py`:**\n  - `annotate_log_rows` strips `_output_message_hashes`.\n  - The result-printing loop is now a nested `_display_tool_results` helper with unchanged output.\n  - The prompt section's `### Tool results` heading prints only local results.\n  - Server results print under `## Response`, after `### Tool calls` and before the response text.\n- **`docs/changelog.md`:** added the bullet under Unreleased.", "ttft_ms": 3790, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 77624, "uuid": "e27e8026-fd7c-4acb-9b83-c5448d99b546", "ttft_stream_ms": 3317, "time_to_request_ms": 52, "first_content_frame_ms": 3317, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
